{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wishart-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1690,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## Wishart distributions and sample covariance\n\nStart with Gaussian outer products, distinguish integer construction from real degrees of freedom, and then follow the sample-covariance law, independence and rank conditions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n从生成对象与参数含义进入精确抽样推断；求逆与概率校准都需要各自的条件。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-definition",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Wishart分布|Wishart distribution]]\n\nFor integer $\\nu\\ge1$, sum $\\nu$ iid centered $p$-dimensional Gaussian outer products with common positive-semidefinite scale $\\Sigma$ to form a $p\\times p$ matrix. A positive-definite scale also gives a density for real $\\nu>p-1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数自由度数生成向量；实数延拓由密度定义。尺度在前，均值矩阵为自由度乘尺度。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-psd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[外积和的半正定性|Outer-product sums are PSD]]\n\nFor a finite real outer-product sum $W=\\sum_i Z_iZ_i^T$, $a^TWa=\\sum_i(a^TZ_i)^2\\ge0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整数生成式的半正定性来自平方和；这一代数保证本身无需独立或正态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-convention",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Wishart参数化|Scale and precision conventions]]\n\nCovariance scale $V$ and precision $V^{-1}$ are different inputs for the same law. In the scale convention, $E[W]=\\nu V$; argument order alone does not identify the convention.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先核对生成式或密度，再校准符号和接口；换参数不等于把随机矩阵取逆。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-sample",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[样本协方差Wishart律|Wishart law of sample covariance]]\n\nFor $n\\ge2$ iid $N_p(\\mu,\\Sigma)$ observations with $\\Sigma$ positive definite, $(n-1)S\\sim W_p(\\Sigma,n-1)$, where $S$ uses divisor $n-1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n中心化后可选出n−1个独立Gaussian对比；原始残差本身通常相关。外积构造也覆盖奇异的样本协方差。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-assumption",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -120,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Wishart抽样假设|Sampling assumptions]]\n\nIndependent, identically distributed joint-Gaussian observations give the standard exact covariance law. Unbiasedness or a shared covariance alone does not determine that law.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非正态、相关行或不同分布，需要重新建立抽样校准；n−1分母本身不能补齐这些条件。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-independence",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -120,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正态均值协方差独立|Mean–covariance independence]]\n\nFor $n\\ge2$ iid Gaussian vectors, the sample mean is independent of the sample covariance. The mean and whole linear residual block have zero cross-covariance and are jointly Gaussian.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n协方差统计量是残差块的函数；该独立性允许总体协方差奇异，也允许样本协方差不可逆。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-rank",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 350,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Wishart秩与可逆性|Rank and invertibility]]\n\nFor integer $\\nu\\ge1$ and positive-definite scale, $\\operatorname{rank}(W)=\\min(p,\\nu)$ almost surely. Under the stated iid Gaussian sample model, $S^{-1}$ exists almost surely iff $n\\ge p+1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非整数正定密度的条件是ν>p−1；不能把整数计数门槛直接套过去。可逆也不保证数值稳定。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-pd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正定与半正定可逆性|From semidefinite to invertible]]\n\nFor a real symmetric positive-semidefinite matrix, full rank, positive definiteness and existence of an ordinary inverse are equivalent.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n半正定允许零方向；满秩才排除这些方向。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
