      "label": "The exact law uses the stated sampling model · 精确分布依赖所述抽样模型"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-edge-sample-independence",
      "fromNode": "wishart-sample",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "wishart-independence",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Mean and residual blocks are independent under Gaussian sampling · Gaussian抽样分离均值与残差块"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-edge-sample-rank",
      "fromNode": "wishart-sample",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "wishart-rank",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Integer n−1 contrasts determine the almost-sure rank · n−1个对比决定几乎必然秩"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-edge-assumption-independence",
      "fromNode": "wishart-assumption",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "wishart-independence",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Common moments alone do not imply independent statistics · 相同矩不能保证统计量独立"
    },
    {
      "id": "wishart-edge-rank-pd",
      "fromNode": "wishart-rank",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "wishart-pd",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Full rank removes zero directions from a PSD matrix · 满秩排除半正定矩阵的零方向"
    }
  ]
}
